    "detailed_description": "<h1>About Game streaming</h1><p>The game is available for live streaming and video content creation. You are free to monetize your streams and videos without seeking permission.<br>Feel free to use the store URL in your stream description as well.<br>Enjoy and have fun!</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Lead the TRAIN by sliding the rails.<br>Get the STARs!<br><br>This game is a sliding puzzle!<br>Slide the rails and lead the train to the goal.<br><br>RULE<br>- The train will start from the start station.<br>- You must lead the train to the goal station by connecting the tracks to the goal station.<br>- You must lead the train to the goal station when you pass the station.<br><br>Stage Editor<br>You can show your creation to players around the world.<br>Of course, you can also play other players' stages.<br><br>Upload the stage data created by the Stage Editor to the server via the Internet.<br>There are three conditions that must be met in order for a stage to be uploaded.<br>- The stage must have a start station and a goal station.<br>- There must be a rail that connects to the start station in the initial state.<br>- The placement of three stars.<br><br>Other users can play stages created by other users by selecting Stage &gt; Online.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Game streaming</h2>The game is available for live streaming and video content creation. You are free to monetize your streams and videos without seeking permission.<br>Feel free to use the store URL in your stream description as well.<br>Enjoy and have fun!",
